### Multi-Courier Integration Platform - HTTP Requests
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client & JetBrains HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@sampleOrderId = ORD-SAMPLE-001

# ==============================================================================
# 0. System Health & Courier Discovery
# ==============================================================================

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### 2. List Supported Couriers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/couriers HTTP/1.1


# ==============================================================================
# 1. User Authentication (JWT)
# ==============================================================================

### 3. Register New User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "engineer@futurevision.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 4. Login User
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "engineer@futurevision.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 5. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}


# ==============================================================================
# 2. Single Order & Shipment Operations
# ==============================================================================

### 6. Create Shipment with UrbaneBolt (Idempotent)
# @name createUrbaneBoltOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "order_id": "ORD-UB-{{$timestamp}}",
  "courier_partner": "urbanebolt",
  "sender": {
    "name": "Rohit Athaley",
    "phone": "9425018023",
    "email": "bhopal@mbdgroup.com",
    "address": "Plot No. 137 Sector-1 Special Industrial Area",
    "city": "Govindpura",
    "state": "BHOPAL",
    "pincode": "122001",
    "country": "India",
    "address_type": "Seller"
  },
  "recipient": {
    "name": "Satyam Convent School",
    "phone": "8320226438",
    "email": "satyam@example.com",
    "address": "Plot No. 26-27, Om Nagar Society",
    "city": "Surat",
    "state": "GUJARAT",
    "pincode": "122017",
    "country": "India",
    "address_type": "Home"
  },
  "package_details": {
    "weight_kg": 1.1,
    "length_cm": 12,
    "breadth_cm": 10,
    "height_cm": 10,
    "items_count": 1,
    "item_description": "Textbooks Package"
  },
  "payment_details": {
    "payment_mode": "COD",
    "collectable_amount": 500,
    "declared_value": 500
  },
  "invoice_details": {
    "invoice_number": "INV-UB-001",
    "invoice_date": "2026-08-18",
    "invoice_value": 500
  },
  "service_type": "SDD"
}

### 7. Create Shipment with MockCourier (Pluggable Second Courier)
# @name createMockOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "order_id": "ORD-MCK-{{$timestamp}}",
  "courier_partner": "mock",
  "sender": {
    "name": "Apex Logistics Hub",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "email": "hub@apex.com",
    "address": "12 Industrial Area Phase 2",
    "city": "Gurugram",
    "state": "Haryana",
    "pincode": "122001",
    "country": "India",
    "address_type": "Seller"
  },
  "recipient": {
    "name": "Alice Smith",
    "phone": "9123456780",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "address": "Flat 401, Skyline Towers",
    "city": "Bengaluru",
    "state": "Karnataka",
    "pincode": "560001",
    "country": "India",
    "address_type": "Home"
  },
  "package_details": {
    "weight_kg": 1.5,
    "length_cm": 15,
    "breadth_cm": 10,
    "height_cm": 8,
    "items_count": 1,
    "item_description": "Smart Watch"
  },
  "payment_details": {
    "payment_mode": "PREPAID",
    "collectable_amount": 0,
    "declared_value": 3499
  },
  "service_type": "STANDARD"
}

### 8. Track Shipment Status (Live Courier Tracking & Timeline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{createMockOrder.response.body.data.order_id}}/track HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 9. Get Order Details from Local Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{createMockOrder.response.body.data.order_id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 10. Cancel Shipment with Courier Partner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{createMockOrder.response.body.data.order_id}}/cancel HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "reason": "Customer requested order cancellation before shipment dispatch"
}


# ==============================================================================
# 3. Bulk Order Processing (Multi-Courier Concurrency)
# ==============================================================================

### 11. Bulk Create Orders (Up to 100 Orders)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/bulk HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "orders": [
    {
      "order_id": "BULK-MCK-01-{{$timestamp}}",
